{"id": "EUVD-2026-98011", "enisaUuid": "4cf22688-c262-3dfd-8d6b-fa506c7b430d", "description": "Frappe ERPNext before 15.121.0 and 16.x before 16.34.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in certain endpoints that fail to enforce proper authorization checks during document creation. Authenticated low-privileged users can send requests to these endpoints to create documents against records beyond their permitted role, bypassing role-based permission restrictions.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T22:22:03", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T12:13:28", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-vr45-2p9x-3vjc", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/frappe-erpnext-before-15.121.0-missing-authorization-in-record-creation-endpoints"], "aliases": ["GHSA-9964-cw4f-c96r", "CVE-2026-109617"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1d7a2b21-d73e-39b8-898a-bf1c8a58e076", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0-beta.1 <16.34.0"}, {"id": "2ae9fa09-be0e-334e-b4b0-911f4cf0878d", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "0 <15.121.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c8794581-73dc-3639-97e6-7b5203b74935", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}